<Root>
  <DefaultMacro>
    <Major>UGC Experience Farm Macro</Major>
    <Description>Experience farm on milastra wonderland. Each server (Asia, Europe, America, etc.) has its own custom game called "Efficient XP Farm". Create a squad of one person (yourself) and run this mode once so that the macro works correctly. The macro is designed for logging into the game and deleting achievements about it (to do this, you must first delete all achievements for the first time (On the PC, click "In" and then level management.)) The macro is set to a resolution of 1920x1080(16:9). If you have a weak device, increase the download delay. Have a good game!</Description>
    <Comment>If you have any questions, please email me.</Comment>
    <GUIOption>
      <RepeatType>2</RepeatType>
    </GUIOption>
    <KeyUp>
      <Syntax></Syntax>
    </KeyUp>
    <KeyDown>
      <Syntax>Delay 64 ms
KeyDown 19 1
//joining a squad
Delay 65 ms
KeyUp 19 1
Delay 2000 ms
KeyDown 9 1
//the beginning of matchmaking (you need to go to the selection area yourself)
Delay 76 ms
KeyUp 9 1
//Wait for ending screen to finish
Delay 23000 ms
//Wait for ending screen to finish
Delay 2 ms
MoveTo 1722 1016
Delay 9 ms
MoveTo 1722 1015
Delay 9 ms
LeftDown 1
Delay 63 ms
LeftUp 1
//Loading out of the game back into lobby
Delay 15000 ms
//Loading out of the game back into lobby
Delay 64
KeyDown 5 1
//Entering the selected limits
Delay 64
KeyUp 5 1
Delay 64
Delay 1500 ms
MoveTo 1687 60
//Logging in to level management
Delay 180 ms
LeftDown 1
Delay 64
LeftUp 1
Delay 1500 ms
KeyDown 9 1
//Management F
Delay 64
KeyUp 9 1
Delay 64
MoveTo 1615 296
//The "Total" mark
